        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p>
            <strong>Effective Date:</strong> January 1, 2026
            <br />
            <strong>Developer:</strong> gerardPolloRebozado
        </p>

        <p>
            This Privacy Policy applies to the watch face applications developed
            by gerardPolloRebozado for the Google Play Store (the "App"). We are
            committed to protecting your privacy and providing full transparency
            regarding how your information is handled.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Collection and Storage</h2>
        <p>
            We do not collect, store, record, or transmit any personal data,
            usage data, or sensitive information. The App operates entirely
            locally on your device.
        </p>

        <h2>Data Sharing and Sales</h2>
        <p>
            Because we do not collect any user data, we do not sell, rent,
            share, or trade any personal information to third parties,
            advertisers, or analytics companies.
        </p>

        <h2>Device Permissions</h2>
        <p>
            The App may request certain on-device permissions (such as accessing
            the heart rate sensor or step counter) solely for the purpose of
            displaying this information directly on your watch face.
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                This data is processed locally on your smartwatch in real-time.
            </li>
            <li>
                This data never leaves your device and is not transmitted to our
                servers or any third-party services.
            </li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
        <p>
            We do not integrate any third-party tracking software, advertising
            SDKs, or analytics tools into the App. Please note that your
            device's operating system (Wear OS) and the Google Play Store may
            collect standard diagnostic or usage data according to Google’s own
            privacy policies, which is completely independent of this App and
            outside of our control.
        </p>

        <h2>Children’s Privacy</h2>
        <p>
            Our App does not intentionally target or collect personal
            information from children under the age of 13, as no data is
            collected from any user regardless of age.
        </p>

